Unreleased: The public library API/SONAME version has increased from 11 to 12.
Applications and extensions linked against the old SONAME need matching old
libraries or a rebuild against the new libraries.

The digested changelog can be found under:
 contrib/debian/changelog

You can also find the exhaustive list of change using git history,
or at the following URL: https://github.com/freeDiameter/freeDiameter/commits/master/
